eneh (EST)&q;,&q;place&q;:0,&q;authority&q;:null,&q;confidence&q;:-1}],&q;fao.leadauthoringunit&q;:[{&q;uuid&q;:&q;58596705-ce99-4093-86ad-f22faa4ee2d6&q;,&q;language&q;:&q;&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;EST - Markets and Trade&q;,&q;place&q;:0,&q;authority&q;:null,&q;confidence&q;:-1}],&q;fao.placeofpublication&q;:[{&q;uuid&q;:&q;7f6980f4-529d-4cc2-801f-d4f205b8483f&q;,&q;language&q;:&q;&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;Rome, Italy ;&q;,&q;place&q;:0,&q;authority&q;:null,&q;confidence&q;:-1}],&q;fao.previewpage&q;:[{&q;uuid&q;:&q;619a9a32-525a-4ab8-ae60-57df1494588f&q;,&q;language&q;:&q;&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&l;p&g;&l;b&g;Markets at a Glance&l;/b&g;&l;/p&g;&l;ul&g;&l;li&g;&l;b&g;&l;i&g;Cereals&l;/i&g;&l;/b&g;&l;/li&g; This report provides an analysis of the most recent developments in the global cereals market, including a short-term outlook.&l;b&g;&l;a href=\&q;https://www.fao.org/3/ce0204en/ce0204en_cereals.pdf\&q; target=\&q;_blank\&q; class=\&q;external-link-new-window\&q; title=\&q;Opens external link in new window\&q; external=\&q;1\&q;&g; Read it here&l;/a&g;&l;/b&g;&l;li&g;&l;b&g;&l;i&g;Wheat&l;/i&g;&l;/b&g;&l;/li&g; This report provides an analysis of the most recent developments in the global wheat market, including a short-term outlook.&l;b&g;&l;a href=\&q;https://www.fao.org/3/ce0204en/ce0204en_wheat.pdf\&q; target=\&q;_blank\&q; class=\&q;external-link-new-window\&q; title=\&q;Opens external link in new window\&q; external=\&q;1\&q;&g; Read it here&l;/a&g;&l;/b&g;&l;li&g;&l;b&g;&l;i&g;Coarse Grains&l;/i&g;&l;/b&g;&l;/li&g;This report provides an analysis of the most recent developments in the global coarse grains market, including a short-term outlook.&l;b&g;&l;a href=\&q;https://www.fao.org/3/ce0204en/ce0204en_grains.pdf\&q;target=\&q;_blank\&q; class=\&q;external-link-new-window\&q; title=\&q;Opens external link in new window\&q; external=\&q;1\&q;&g; Read it here&l;/a&g;&l;/b&g;&l;li&g;&l;b&g;&l;i&g;Rice&l;/i&g;&l;/b&g;&l;/li&g; This report provides an analysis of the most recent developments in the global rice market, including a short-term outlook.&l;b&g;&l;a href=\&q;https://www.fao.org/3/ce0204en/ce0204en_rice.pdf\&q;target=\&q;_blank\&q; class=\&q;external-link-new-window\&q; title=\&q;Opens external link in new window\&q; external=\&q;1\&q;&g; Read it here&l;/a&g;&l;/b&g;&l;li&g;&l;b&g;&l;i&g;Oilcrops, oils and meals&l;/i&g;&l;/b&g;&l;/li&g;This report provides an analysis of the most recent developments in the global oilcrops market, including a short-term outlook.&l;b&g;&l;a href=\&q;https://www.fao.org/3/ce0204en/ce0204en_oilcrops.pdf\&q;target=\&q;_blank\&q; class=\&q;external-link-new-window\&q; title=\&q;Opens external link in new window\&q; external=\&q;1\&q;&g; Read it here&l;/a&g;&l;/b&g;&l;li&g;&l;b&g;&l;i&g;Sugar&l;/i&g;&l;/b&g;&l;/li&g;This report provides an analysis of the most recent developments in the global sugar market, including a short-term outlook.&l;b&g;&l;a href=\&q;https://www.fao.org/3/ce0204en/ce0204en_sugar.pdf\&q;target=\&q;_blank\&q; class=\&q;external-link-new-window\&q; title=\&q;Opens external link in new window\&q; external=\&q;1\&q;&g; Read it here&l;/a&g;&l;/b&g;&l;li&g;&l;b&g;&l;i&g;Meat and meat products&l;/i&g;&l;/b&g;&l;/li&g;This report provides an analysis of the most recent developments in the global meat market, including a short-term outlook.&l;b&g;&l;a href=\&q;https://www.fao.org/3/ce0204en/ce0204en_meat.pdf\&q;target=\&q;_blank\&q; class=\&q;external-link-new-window\&q; title=\&q;Opens external link in new window\&q; external=\&q;1\&q;&g; Read it here&l;/a&g;&l;/b&g;&l;li&g;&l;b&g;&l;i&g;Milk and milk products&l;/i&g;&l;/b&g;&l;/li&g;This report provides an analysis of the most recent developments in the global milk market, including a short-term outlook.&l;b&g;&l;a href=\&q;https://www.fao.org/3/ce0204en/ce0204en_milk.pdf\&q;target=\&q;_blank\&q; class=\&q;external-link-new-window\&q; title=\&q;Opens external link in new window\&q; external=\&q;1\&q;&g; Read it here&l;/a&g;&l;/b&g;&l;li&g;&l;b&g;&l;i&g;Fish and other acquatic products&a;nbsp;&l;/i&g;&l;/b&g;&l;/li&g;This report provides an analysis of the most recent developments in the global fish market, including a short-term outlook.&l;b&g;&l;a href=\&q;https://www.fao.org/3/ce0204en/ce0204en_fish.pdf\&q; target=\&q;_blank\&q; class=\&q;external-link-new-window\&q; title=\&q;Opens external link in new window\&q; external=\&q;1\&q;&g; Read it here&l;br&g;&l;/a&g;&l;/b&g;&l;/ul&g;&l;p&g;&l;/p&g;&l;p&g;&l;b&g;Special feature&l;/b&g;&l;/p&g;&l;p&g;&l;i&g;Using alternative fuels for international maritime shipping: implications for Small Island Developing States&l;/i&g;&l;/p&g;&l;p&g;Maritime shipping is accelerating trials of alternative fuels, driven by the International Maritime Organization’s (IMO) pathway to decarbonize the internationalmaritime sector. &l;b&g;&l;a href=\&q;https://www.fao.org/3/ce0204en/ce0204en_special_feature1.pdf\&q;target=\&q;_blank\&q; class=\&q;external-link-new-window\&q; title=\&q;Opens external link in new window\&q; external=\&q;1\&q;&g;Read it here&l;/a&g;&l;/b&g;&l;/p&g;&l;p&g;&l;i&g;&l;br&g;Energy market uncertainty and ethanol–sugar price linkages&l;/i&g;&l;/p&g;&l;p&g;Energy markets, which are naturally volatile, have faced even greater uncertainty, driven by price swings, geopolitical risks, and an uneven energy transition. &l;a href=\&q;https://www.fao.org/3/ce0204en/ce0204en_special_feature2.pdf\&q;&g;Read it here&l;/a&g;&l;/p&g;&l;p&g;&l;i&g;&l;br&g;Fertilizer market update&l;/i&g;&l;/p&g;&l;p&g;The Fertilizer Market Update reviews global fertilizer production, utilization, and trade in 2025, and then examines separately the disruptions and market developments that intensified in early 2026. &l;a href=\&q;https://www.fao.org/3/ce0204en/ce0204en_special_feature3.pdf\&q;&g;Read it here&l;/a&g;&l;/p&g;&l;p&g;&l;i&g;&l;br&g;&l;/i&g;&l;/p&g;&q;,&q;place&q;:0,&q;authority&q;:null,&q;confidence&q;:-1}],&q;fao.sdgs&q;:[{&q;uuid&q;:&q;7a4c936b-cd6f-423d-9a47-62cfdc