;,&q;value&q;:&q;Rome, Italy ;&q;,&q;place&q;:0,&q;authority&q;:null,&q;confidence&q;:-1}],&q;fao.previewpage&q;:[{&q;uuid&q;:&q;beff9024-caf1-4adf-a706-6c4ff879a59b&q;,&q;language&q;:&q;&q;,&q;value&q;:&q;&l;p&g;The following FAO SDG briefs are available for download:&l;/p&g;&l;ul&g;  &l;li&g;&l;a href=\&q;https://www.fao.org/3/cd8857en/fao-sdg1.pdf\&q; target=\&q;_blank\&q;&g;FAO and SDG 1: End poverty in all its forms everywhere&l;/a&g;&l;/li&g;  &l;li&g;&l;a href=\&q;https://www.fao.org/3/cd8857en/fao-sdg2.pdf\&q; target=\&q;_blank\&q;&g;FAO and SDG 2: End hunger, achieve food security and improved nutrition and promote sustainable agriculture&l;/a&g;&l;/li&g;  &l;li&g;&l;a href=\&q;https://www.fao.org/3/cd8857en/fao-sdg3.pdf\&q; target=\&q;_blank\&q;&g;FAO and SDG 3: Ensure healthy lives and promote well-being for all at all ages&l;/a&g;&l;/li&g;  &l;li&g;&l;a href=\&q;https://www.fao.org/3/cd8857en/fao-sdg4.pdf\&q; target=\&q;_blank\&q;&g;FAO and SDG 4: Ensure inclusive and equitable quality education and promote lifelong learning opportunities for all&l;/a&g;&l;/li&g;  &l;li&g;&l;a href=\&q;https://www.fao.org/3/cd8857en/fao-sdg5.pdf\&q; target=\&q;_blank\&q;&g;FAO and SDG 5: Achieve gender equality and empower all women and girls&l;/a&g;&l;/li&g;  &l;li&g;&l;a href=\&q;https://www.fao.org/3/cd8857en/fao-sdg6.pdf\&q; target=\&q;_blank\&q;&g;FAO and SDG 6: Ensure availability and sustainable management of water and sanitation for all&l;/a&g;&l;/li&g;  &l;li&g;&l;a href=\&q;https://www.fao.org/3/cd8857en/fao-sdg7.pdf\&q; target=\&q;_blank\&q;&g;FAO and SDG 7: Ensure access to affordable, reliable, sustainable and modern energy for all&l;/a&g;&l;/li&g;  &l;li&g;&l;a href=\&q;https://www.fao.org/3/cd8857en/fao-sdg8.pdf\&q; target=\&q;_blank\&q;&g;FAO and SDG 8: Promote sustained, inclusive and sustainable economic growth, full and productive employment and decent work for all&l;/a&g;&l;/li&g;  &l;li&g;&l;a href=\&q;https://www.fao.org/3/cd8857en/fao-sdg9.pdf\&q; 